    PROGRAMMERS:\nGABRIEL CHAVE\n\nCONCEPT ART:\nARTHUR ROQUE\nCAIO FREITAS\nCAIO
    NERES\nJO\xC3O HENRIQUE\nRODRIGO STEHLING\nVICTOR DINIZ\n\nGAME DESIGN REVIEW:\nBERNARDO
    BONES\nCAIO FREITAS\nJO\xC3O HENRIQUE\n\n2D ASSETS:\nCAIO FREITAS\nCAIO NERES\nJOAO
    HENRIQUE\nVICTOR DINIZ\n\n3D ASSETS:\nARTHUR ROQUE\nBERNARDO BONES\nCAIO FREITAS\nCAIO
    NERES\nERIC CATARINA\nGABRIEL CHAVE\nJO\xC3O HENRIQUE\nLUCAS AQUINO\nRODRIGO
    STEHLING\nVICTOR DINIZ\nVINICIUS AUGUSTO\n\n2D ANIMATIONS:\nCAIO FREITAS\nJO\xC3O
